  {
   "id": "e2-be-verbs",
   "subject": "english",
   "grade": 2,
   "title": "am / is / are",
   "intro": [
    "I → am；he / she / it 或單數名詞 → is；you / we / they 或眾數 → are。例：I am Tom. She is a nurse. They are happy."
   ],
   "questions": [
    {
     "type": "choice",
     "prompt": "I ___ a student.",
     "answer": "am",
     "choices": [
      "am",
      "is",
      "are",
      "be"
     ],
     "tag": "e-grammar-be"
    },
