  {
   "id": "e4-past-tense",
   "subject": "english",
   "grade": 4,
   "title": "Simple Past Tense 簡單過去式",
   "intro": [
    "說已經發生的事用過去式。規則動詞加 -ed（played）；不規則動詞要背：go → went, see → saw, eat → ate, have → had。"
   ],
   "questions": [
    {
     "type": "choice",
     "prompt": "Yesterday I ___ to the library.",
     "answer": "went",
     "choices": [
      "went",
      "go",
      "goed",
      "going"
     ],
     "tag": "e-grammar-past"
    },
    {
     "type": "choice",
