  {
   "id": "e5-comparatives",
   "subject": "english",
   "grade": 5,
   "title": "Comparatives 比較級",
   "intro": [
    "短形容詞加 -er（taller, faster），後面常接 than。長形容詞前加 more（more beautiful）。不規則：good → better, bad → worse。"
   ],
   "questions": [
    {
     "type": "choice",
     "prompt": "Tom is ___ than Ben. (tall)",
     "answer": "taller",
     "choices": [
      "taller",
      "more tall",
      "tallest",
      "tallest than"
     ],
     "tag": "e-grammar-compare"
    },
